OL,3,GNEWSAShould hyperscale AI data centres 
OL,4,Abe paused?                             
OL,6,FIf you're a data centre geek you could 
OL,7,Ffly to Virginia, USA, the only place   
OL,8,Fyou'll find more of them. Or you could 
OL,9,Fhead to Slough, home to the UK's data  
OL,10,Fcentre industry.                       
OL,12,FThese centres have been working quietly
OL,13,Fin the background for more than 25     
OL,14,Fyears. Until recently they received    
OL,15,Flittle attention.                      
OL,17,FThe rise of Artificial Intelligence    
OL,18,F(AI) has changed that and the industry 
OL,19,Fis now building more and much bigger   
OL,20,Fdata centres to cope with extra demand 
OL,21,Ffor the technology.                    
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
