OL,3,GNEWSAShould hyperscale AI data centres 
OL,4,Abe paused?                             
OL,6,FCampaigners in Slough want the         
OL,7,Fgovernment to slow down the roll-out of
OL,8,Fthe new breed of much larger so-called 
OL,9,Fhyperscale data centres with ministers 
OL,10,Fsaying the growth of AI is key to the  
OL,11,Fcountry's economic future.             
